sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADV as Advisor
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as StudentDataController
    participant S as StudentDataService
    participant G as IAccessGuardService
    participant K as IAttributeKeyService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADV->>W: "View as of" 2026-10-31, time axis = valid
    W->>C: GET /api/StudentData/students/{studentId}/as-of?date&timeAxis
    C->>S: GetAsOfAsync(AccessorId, StudentId, request)
    S->>R: STUDENTDATA rows of the student
    R->>DB: SELECT
    alt timeAxis = system
        S->>S: Per attribute and term: latest row with transactionFrom up to the date
    else timeAxis = valid
        S->>S: Among rows with validFrom up to the date: latest validFrom, later transactionFrom wins ties
    end
    S->>G: CheckAccessAsync(accessor, student, attributes, null)
    G-->>S: decisions
    S->>K: DecryptValuesAsync(allowed rows)
    S->>G: LogAccessBatchAsync(one row per value shown, with studentDataId)
    G->>R: INSERT ACCESSLOGS
    S-->>C: Snapshot (values, sources, missing notices, "exists, not shared")
    C-->>W: 200 OK
